# Defense-in-depth: both Dockerfiles already COPY selectively, so this only
# keeps machine-local state and build artifacts out of the build context.
# Every pattern is depth-agnostic (**/). Probe 2026-10-10: bare `.git` /
# `test-results` / `*.log` match only at the context root, so the nested
# backend/.env (machine-local secret, README quick-start) was NOT excluded —
# fixed by **/ forms, verified: only `.env.example` (both depths) survives.
**/.git
**/.claude
**/docs
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.playwright-mcp
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
